# Server-only Resend settings. Copy into .env.local — never commit real values.
# Do not prefix these names with NEXT_PUBLIC_.
#
# Hosting (Vercel / similar): add the same names as encrypted environment variables
# for Production and Preview. INQUIRY_FROM_EMAIL must be a Resend-verified sender.
# LDS_INQUIRY_TO is optional; when omitted the API uses the two LDS inboxes below.

